<div class="d-cap">On the left, the first solution that came to mind is implemented straight away. On the right, different directions and intervention points are laid out first, unknowns are discovered, and only then does it converge. That is the difference Thariq called &ldquo;searching the space and moving forward.&rdquo;</div>
